      "claim": "SMI_ReadRom treats0xc2 as success-with-protection and does not copy the block. ReadCurrentROM initially zeros the destination, leaving protected blocks zero-filled; the full-ROM reader tracks this condition for a completion warning. A successful exit and correct file size do not prove a complete dump.",
